hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3075","###\n Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar, who said: Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Ja'far, who said: Narrated to us Shu'bah, from Ibrahim ibn Muhajir, from Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith, who said: Marwan sent someone to Umm Ma'qil to ask her about this hadith. She narrated that her husband had dedicated a cow (bakr) in the way of Allah. She intended to perform 'Umrah and asked her husband"
